  data: {
    LLM: "In Phase 1, try to win tricks with high cards of the same suit. This gives you 'runs' in Phase 2, which are very hard for opponents to beat (they must beat the whole run).\n\nHand Balancing: Don't win every trick in Phase 1. If you have too many cards in Phase 2, you are more likely to get stuck picking up even more.\n\nThe Sequence Trap: In Phase 2, if you have a sequence like 8-9-10 of Spades, wait until your opponent plays a low Spade. Then dump the entire sequence on them. They will likely have to pick it up, adding 3 cards to their hand.",
    Player: "In Phase 1, try to win tricks with high cards of the same suit. This gives you 'runs' in Phase 2, which are very hard for opponents to beat (they must beat the whole run).\n\nHand Balancing: Don't win every trick in Phase 1. If you have too many cards in Phase 2, you are more likely to get stuck picking up even more.\n\nThe Sequence Trap: In Phase 2, if you have a sequence like 8-9-10 of Spades, wait until your opponent plays a low Spade. Then dump the entire sequence on them. They will likely have to pick it up, adding 3 cards to their hand.",
