    advanced: 'The Sequence Trap: In Phase 2, if you have a sequence like 8-9-10 of Spades, wait until your opponent plays a low Spade. Then dump the entire sequence on them. They will likely have to pick it up, adding 3 cards to their hand.',
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Keep track of the Aces during Phase 1. Knowing who has the 'Exit cards' for Phase 2 is vital.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'If you are leading in Phase 2, lead your middle-range cards first. Save your Aces for when you need to capture a trick to lead again.',
